A colleague comes up to me.
He smiles and says, "Hello, I am Jonas."
"I am Maya," I answer.
"Welcome to the company!" Jonas says.
Here in the office, we all say "du".
"Where do you come from, Maya?" he asks.
"I come from Mexico," I say.
"And how long have you been in Berlin?"
"I have been here since January," I answer.
Jonas nods warmly.
"We are eight people on the team," he says.
"We have many projects."
"The team is young."
"I am twenty-nine years old," Jonas says.
"I am thirty-one years old," I say.
"We work together a lot here," he explains.
"I really like working in a team," I answer.
"That is great," Jonas laughs.
"Your desk is over there," he says.
